{:answer/id #uuid "d9a9ee83-d903-53aa-9d6f-4e3993afc0b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in (-\\infty ,\\frac{2}{3}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566801} {:answer/id #uuid "ed17c8a6-29f1-5ae1-b918-ca68a08959c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [\\frac{2}{3},\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566843}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3c9c3021-dc8e-5f74-8aaf-4a60914dd2d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in (-\\infty ,0]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566485} :answer-field/id #uuid "bf4b9335-0fd1-5bb9-abfb-4375e1dfaa2a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566966}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b4003a70-0f14-5734-a7b0-b2973b43dc61" :question/math-academy-id "q-98664" :question/problem "What is the range of $f(x)=-3\\sqrt[6]{2-3x}?$" :question/worked-solution "The range of $\\sqrt[6]{x}$ is\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[6]{x}\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nHorizontal shifts and stretches do not affect the range. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[6]{2-3x}\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[6]{2-3x} & \\ge 0 \\\\ -3\\sqrt[6]{2-3x} & \\le 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the range of the given function is $f(x)\\in (-\\infty ,0].$\n\nWe can also see that this is true from the graph of the function. The graph of $y=f(x)$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/ce/ce3b0c967ed01cfad58df6cf2c8f014d74dbde0e0438d401dcef04b2e359baa5.png)"}]}
